      "scene_type": "gritwerk_paper",
      "duration_hint": 18,
      "spoken": "The researcher Sophie Leroy showed in two experiments that people who switch away from an unfinished task struggle to let go of it. And they then do worse on the next task. Even finishing the first task was not always enough for a clean switch.",
